@startuml
title Benders Decomposition for Cell Suppression Problem (CSP)

start

:Define Parameters;
note right
  - Table values (a) and linear relations (Aa=b)
  - Set of primary sensitive cells (P)
  - Protection levels (lpl, upl)
end note

:Initialize Master Problem;
note right
  Initially unrestricted or with basic bounds
end note

repeat
  :Solve Master Problem (MILP);
  note right
    Minimize cost: Σ w_i * y_i
    Result: Current suppression pattern (y)
  end note

  partition "Subproblem Verification (for each p ∈ P)" {
    :Solve Dual Subproblem (Auditor);
    note right
      Find min/max deviations (x^l,p and x^u,p) 
      given the current suppressions (y)
    end note

    if (Is protection sufficient?) then (Yes)
      :Sensitive cell p is protected;
    else (No)
      :Generate Benders Cut (Restriction);
      note left
        Identify extreme rays/vertices of 
        dual polyhedron U 
      end note
      :Add Cut to Master Problem;
    endif
  }

repeat while (Any sensitive cell unprotected?) is (Yes)

:Finalize Optimal Suppression Pattern (S);
note right
  Set of primary (P) and secondary (S) cells
end note

stop
@enduml